      <Placemark>
        <name>Paradise Village Route</name>
        <description><![CDATA[more cebu jeepneys route maps at cebujeepneys.weebly.com (http://cebujeepneys.weebly.com)<br>Like us on our Facebook Page (http://www.facebook.com/cebujeepneysroutemap)<br><br> <br>This is the route extension of 22i. If you ride from country mall that dont come from the Terminal at country mall they pass on this route going to paradise then to the route to foodland and so on. <br><br> <br>If you are from Mandaue Public Market, some dont enter into the Country Mall Terminal. The go directily to Paradise Village.]]></description>
